>\n\n    <div class=\"lb-track-outer\">\n      <div class=\"lb-track\" id=\"lbTrack\">\n\n        <div class=\"lb-card\">\n          <div class=\"lb-photo\"><img src=\"https://smooche.com/cdn/shop/files/33e038b0-0311-4fba-aca3-dec93cc2084d_800x800.jpg?v=1765899523\" alt=\"Nadine, 61\"></div>\n          <div class=\"lb-card-body\">\n            <div class=\"lb-card-top\">\n              <span class=\"lb-name\">Nadine, 61</span>\n              <span class=\"lb-stars\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-verified\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.4 1.9 3-.6 1 2.9 2.9 1-.6 3L22 12l-1.3 2.8.6 3-2.9 1-1 2.9-3-.6L12 22l-2.4-1.9-3 .6-1-2.9-2.9-1 .6-3L2 12l1.3-2.8-.6-3 2.9-1 1-2.9 3 .6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n              Verified Purchase\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-quote\">\"I honestly thought my foundation days were over. At 61, everything I tried would settle into my smile lines within an hour and turn orange by lunch. I'd resigned myself to just using tinted moisturizer. Then my daugh