\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n              Verified Purchase\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-quote\">\"I've spent over $300 in the past year alone returning foundations that didn't work. Wrong shade, oxidized, settled into lines—you name it. I was terrified to try another one. But the shade-match guarantee convinced me to give it ONE more shot. I've never looked back.\"</div>\n            <button class=\"lb-readmore\">Read More</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"lb-card\">\n          <div class=\"lb-photo\"><img src=\"https://smooche.com/cdn/shop/files/cf566b7c-fe4d-4cb4-bcf9-ddd5675aae80_800x800.jpg?v=1765899885\" alt=\"Mona, 58\"></div>\n          <div class=\"lb-card-body\">\n            <div class=\"lb-card-top\">\n              <span class=\"lb-name\">Mona, 58</span>\n              <span class=\"lb-stars\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-verified\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.4 1.9 3-.6 1 2.9 2.9 1-.6 3L22 12l-1.3 2.8.6 3-2.9 1-1 2.9-3-.6L12 22l-2.4-1.9-3 .6-1-2.9-2.9-1 .6-3L2 12l1.3-2.8-.6-3 2.9-1 1-2.9 3 .6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n              Verified Purchase\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-quote\">\"I'm a retired chemist, so I'm VERY skeptical of beauty marketing claims. But I watched the formula literally transform on my skin—within 60 seconds it matched my exact tone, including the subtle pink undertone I can never find in stores. This is real science, not marketing hype.\"</div>\n            <button class=\"lb-readmore\">Read More</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"lb-card\">\n          <div class=\"lb-photo\"><img src=\"https://smooche.com/cdn/shop/files/a19b245c-653f-4899-8a11-20a81c06afcd_800x800.jpg?v=1765899716\" alt=\"Rania, 62\"></div>\n          <div class=\"lb-card-body\">\n            <div class=\"lb-card-top\">\n              <span class=\"lb-name\">Rania, 62</span>\n              <span class=\"lb-stars\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.6 1.7 7-6.3-3.9-6.3 3.9 1.7-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-verified\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.4 1.9 3-.6 1 2.9 2.9 1-.6 3L22 12l-1.3 2.8.6 3-2.9 1-1 2.9-3-.6L12 22l-2.4-1.9-3 .6-1-2.9-2.9-1 .6-3L2 12l1.3-2.8-.6-3 2.9-1 1-2.9 3 .6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n              Verified Purchase\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lb-quote\">\"My 28-year-old daughter is a beauty influencer and she sent me this saying 'Mom, you NEED to try this.' Ladies, LISTEN TO YOUR DAUGHTERS. This is magic. No settling, no oxidation, and it actually made me look 10 years younger.\"</div>\n            <button class=\"lb-readmore\">Read More</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"lb-arrow next\" id=\"lbNext\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  const track = document.getElementById('lbTrack');\n  const cards = track.querySelectorAll('.lb-card');\n  const prevBtn = document.getElementById('lbPrev');\n  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('lbNext');\n  let index = 0;\n\n  function getPerView() {\n    const w = window.innerWidth;\n    if (w <= 520) return 1;\n    if (w <= 900) return 2;\n    return 4;\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    const perView = getPerView();\n    const maxIndex = Math.max(0, cards.length - perView);\n    if (index > maxIndex) index = maxIndex;\n    const cardWidth = cards[0].getBoundingClientRect().width + 16;\n    track.style.transform = 'translateX(-' + (index * cardWidth) + 'px)';\n  }\n\n  prevBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    index = Math.max(0, index - 1);\n    update();\n  });\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const perView = getPerView();\n    const maxIndex = Math.max(0, cards.length - perView);\n    index = Math.min(maxIndex, index + 1);\n    update();\n  });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', update);\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.lb-readmore').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const quote = this.previousElementSibling;\n      const expanded = quote.classList.toggle('expanded');\n      this.textContent = expanded ? 'Read Less' : 'Read More';\n    });\n  });\n\n  update();\n})();\n</script>",
